  "body": "In https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#prepare-a-script, it says \r\n\r\n> Let source text be the value of the text IDL attribute.\r\n\r\nThis should instead say,\r\n\r\n> Let source text be the script element's child text content.\r\n\r\n(with \"child text content\" linking appropriately.)\r\n\r\nThis is a quick best-practice editorial fix that just makes it depend on the underlying concept, instead of on the public API. It's a good first bug. (Related: #3384.)",
